title: Page wrote to the clipboard
severity: low
score: 5
tags: clipboard
attack: T1115
description: The page wrote to the clipboard (informational). Copy buttons, share links and
  coupon codes do this on a click. The rule exists so that the report shows every write,
  command or not. It does not fire alongside another clipboard rule.
---
// The page wrote to the clipboard, and no other clipboard rule applies: no command, no
// path disguise, no write without a click and no paste-into-Run payload.
clipboard_writes
| where not(exists(clipboard_commands))
    and not(exists(filefix_writes))
    and not(exists(no_gesture_writes))
    and not(exists(paste_lure_writes))
| project text = substring(text, 0, 300), api, user_activation, frame_url
